{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9001_p", "source_sha256": "eda0441a7ab17589c7463a06feb08606b91ff951aaad0145270a5b1d00bda649", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影で、\n杏奈のテーマは『路地裏キッズ』だ）", "zh": "（这是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄，杏奈的主题是“巷子里的孩子”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9002_024ann", "source_sha256": "f886bc8e255fc7b0fdbf8d20e8228ff6f9bd20e943b202c688c88ddc9c83df60", "ja": "他人と関わるのが苦手で……一人で強く生きる子……。\n杏奈、こういう設定……好きかも……。", "zh": "我不太擅长和别人打交道……是个独自坚强生活的孩子……  \n杏奈或许喜欢这种设定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9003_024ann", "source_sha256": "89d1c2cc12ac4355bcd7b7b175ac3d4e332a37b8281c2d8db2cc89d5730bd8b6", "ja": "悪い人、いっぱいの路地裏……。こっそり隠れたり、\n戦いを仕掛けたり……すごく、かっこいい……♪", "zh": "坏人很多的小巷……悄悄躲起来，或者主动发起战斗……感觉好帅……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9004_p", "source_sha256": "c0e753473881267d25b5fc6935ca661ab89be6b0ca8fd624dc63eb1c91ce3f7f", "ja": "戦う……かはともかく、杏奈なりにイメージを\n広げられてるってことだな。うん、いいじゃないか。", "zh": "战斗……先不说这个，总之杏奈能按照自己的方式展开想象了。嗯，不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9005_024ann", "source_sha256": "666e0bb23d4b6a14eed371029de41b2e0a625eacae2ebb3897cef351a18b2ca9", "ja": "ん……。{$P$}さん、あの、ね……。\n{$P$}さんは、こういう子好き……？", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}先生，那个……  \n{$P$}先生喜欢这样的孩子吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9006_p", "source_sha256": "367103f389a1a2ed28db13f8d3a71fbca55d483a035609c1a331a8122e9f4423", "ja": "うん？　そうだな……。", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9007", "source_sha256": "226fdde70280381331d25525ecc19d18c915413cc88fe2413ca3cc9cdce624eb", "ja": "好き", "zh": "喜欢", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9008", "source_sha256": "42f233aa973c95da4ae01e0138bae7681a562ed8b83e3dcdba91644bfb015842", "ja": "ちょっと怖い", "zh": "有点害怕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9200_p", "source_sha256": "75457f8dcf4f11feb5c1303d54b090ccdbdec521920a135563a117ba756fa322", "ja": "カッコよくて、いいよな！　危険な状況にあっても、\n自分のスタイルを崩さない姿とか、憧れるなぁ。", "zh": "帅气又很棒吧！身处危险之中，\n却依然不改自己风格的姿态，真让人憧憬啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9201_024ann", "source_sha256": "502252cda6594238255eea38279127021f44f81a5d0d97e7c070719aa7a8f3a3", "ja": "杏奈も、同じ……。杏奈だったらって、考えたら……\nううっ。怖くて、きっとデバフかかっちゃう……。", "zh": "杏奈也一样……要是换作杏奈的话……呜呜，好害怕，肯定会被施加减益效果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9202_024ann", "source_sha256": "b71eb3f0f3a98f3bfd6f0bcf0d8249df29d6607d7aaef08992e2c3bf4de9270e", "ja": "でも、この子みたいになれたら……。怖がらずに、\nなんでもできるように……なりたい、です……♪", "zh": "可是，如果能变得像这个孩子一样……不再害怕，什么都能做到……我想成为那样的人……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9300_p", "source_sha256": "75457f8dcf4f11feb5c1303d54b090ccdbdec521920a135563a117ba756fa322", "ja": "カッコよくて、いいよな！　危険な状況にあっても、\n自分のスタイルを崩さない姿とか、憧れるなぁ。", "zh": "帅气又很棒吧！身处危险之中，\n却依然不改自己风格的姿态，真让人憧憬啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9301_024ann", "source_sha256": "be78c896d27de5127b4ad9c8fb0fe8b400ce27f01d6ced911c9d8a21f56b77e5", "ja": "杏奈も、憧れるけど……。んー……ムリ、かも……。\nいろんな練習、いっぱいしないと……。", "zh": "杏奈也很憧憬……可是……嗯……可能做不到……得进行好多种练习才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9302_024ann", "source_sha256": "108ea3b952d25a8406c09de89bdd5eea36254d0b16aab6549d53e74630e81d39", "ja": "路地裏のこと、覚えて……戦い方を考えて……。\nどれぐらい頑張ったら……マネ、できるかな……？", "zh": "记住小巷里的情况……思考战斗的方法……。\n要努力到什么程度……才能模仿得来呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9500_p", "source_sha256": "2ba3cda4fc0c7269a5b5101c1c57b89f8f123c276513b6a756e64d6eab018708", "ja": "ちょっとだけど、怖いってイメージもあるかな。\nそこが、カッコいいのはわかるんだけど……。", "zh": "虽然只有一点点，但也给人有些可怕的印象吧。\n我知道那正是帅气的地方，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9501_024ann", "source_sha256": "7e6efbe0e7228e20f52ead758f0934c1b4284f5f3e60cb31821e939d1953fb1a", "ja": "そう、なんだ……。杏奈は、実は優しい、みたいのも、\n好きだけど……最後までクールなのも好き、です……。", "zh": "这样啊……杏奈也喜欢那种其实很温柔的感觉，不过……一直酷到最后的样子，我也喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9502_024ann", "source_sha256": "74bd8fbb7a6659cc650d23bb2566342973f7a3d339824c3c0bb72f863d1a15d9", "ja": "撮影、頑張って……クールなこの子を……\nみんなに好きになって、もらうね……えへへ……♪", "zh": "拍摄要加油……让大家喜欢上这个酷酷的孩子……嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9600_p", "source_sha256": "2ba3cda4fc0c7269a5b5101c1c57b89f8f123c276513b6a756e64d6eab018708", "ja": "ちょっとだけど、怖いってイメージもあるかな。\nそこが、カッコいいのはわかるんだけど……。", "zh": "虽然只有一点点，但也给人有些可怕的印象吧。\n我知道那正是帅气的地方，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9601_024ann", "source_sha256": "94432f7ccc76337960bd0eeeae87a44099a330033330a2e924034441a76f95be", "ja": "うーん……杏奈も、話しかけることになったら……\nちょっとだけ、不安……かも……。", "zh": "嗯……如果要让杏奈主动搭话的话……可能，会有一点点不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_9602_024ann", "source_sha256": "bc8549b7dc5877581d510132af1e74f1474ac331c3abcfc331408a8a81dbd376", "ja": "怖さをなくせばいい、のかな……？　えっと……\nえっと……{$P$}さん助けてぇ……。", "zh": "只要消除害怕的感觉就好了……吗？那个……那个……{$P$}先生救救我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
